WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.680
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.860
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:50.630
THE DARK LORD HADLAR'S RETURN

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.450
So that's the island.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:24.080
That crafty little...

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.160
Puff!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.760
Master turned into a Dragon!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:44.100
Puff! It's an ancient
mythical attack spell!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.390
I never thought I'd see it used!

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.850
He's much bigger than the last one!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:54.820
Among all monsters,
Dragons are the most powerful!

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:59.780
Only a true Hero can fight one
and overcome it!

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.820
Now face me, Dai!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.450
This is going too far!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.200
Get back, Grampa!

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.170
I told you.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.840
A Dragon's skin is harder than steel.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:26.760
Then I'll use Avan Style Sword Technique,
Earth Slash!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:30.350
You cannot win simply with brute strength!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.100
Dai!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:50.080
Hmm. That's not it.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.920
What the hell?! Don't scare me like that!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.590
L-Listen, I wasn't training
to compete with Dai.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:03.430
I want to be perfectly clear about that.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.760
I don't know what sort of
heavy training he's doing's, but...

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.350
Master Avan?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.350
What about Master...

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.440
What?!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:18.770
He didn't!

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.950
How could he do something like that?!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:29.620
Dai can barely use Crack! How is he
going to stop a Dragon's flames?!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.790
Dai!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.710
That's enough!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.540
I'm fine, Grampa!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:44.760
<i>Earth Slash is a strength-based attack.
I can't face a Dragon's flames with it.</i>

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:48.800
<i>Slice the earth, slice the sea,
slice the air.</i>

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:54.310
The Avan Style Sword Technique
is based on these three skills.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:58.900
Yesterday, you attained Earth Slash,
the ability to slice the earth.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.730
Now I shall explain the next skill.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.240
Slice the sea.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:07.990
The key to this attack is speed.
In other words, agility.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.990
WAVE SLASH
SPEED

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.450
Beating a Dragon's flames
requires an attack that slices the sea!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.120
Wave Slash!

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.840
Avan Style Sword Technique...

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.510
I see you've caught on.
But will it work?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:34.520
Oh no!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.810
Don't do it, Dai!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.230
Wave Slash!

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:45.940
Dai!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.740
He sliced... the flames!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.340
Master...

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:09.720
Dai!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:15.720
I did it.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.060
Master, are you okay?

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.690
It stings.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:24.360
It's your own fault, Master.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.400
Using Puff for training is crazy.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:30.660
What if you burned Dai to a crisp?

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:36.750
Well, remember when Dai split the sea
when he faced that Gargoyle?

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.580
I thought he might be able
to pull off Wave Slash right away.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.500
Don't do things like that on a hunch!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:48.340
You seem rather upset.
Were you really that worried?

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.340
N-No I wasn't.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:59.310
If Earth Slash is a strength attack,
Wave Slash is a speed attack.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:06.030
With the strength you already had, your
speed has increased these last few days.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:10.200
So he was able to slice the flames
with the pressure from his quick slash.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:15.240
Yep. Wave Slash is for slicing
formless things like fire and water.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.490
Precisely!

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:23.210
If you master this skill, you can slice
flames and blizzards to attack enemies!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.710
And Dai has already figured out
how to do Wave Slash!

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:30.800
At this rate, completing the
Special Hard Course could be a reality...

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:35.850
It stings.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.810
Maybe a light Crack spell to cool it?

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.310
In that case, perhaps Dai should do it.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.440
That might be perfect.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.110
Crack!

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.410
A very nice size!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.160
What do you mean by "nice"?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.370
This is quite embarrassing.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.750
But Popp, why are you here?

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:08.840
Huh?

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.170
I was forced to come here.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.970
Huh. Popp was training alone?

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:18.310
Hey! Don't!

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.100
Huh? To compete with me?

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.230
Knock it off! I wasn't training!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.240
An earthquake!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.070
What is it? A volcanic eruption?!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.570
No. It's something else.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.120
This shaking...

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.660
is from someone trying to
breach the island's magic circle!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:44.500
What?!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.010
Who is it?!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.300
A servant of the Dark Lord of course!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.890
This island is protected
by a magic circle that repels evil!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.770
Only bad guys can't come in!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:08.150
<i>But a normal monster
wouldn't be able to set foot inside.</i>

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.480
<i>Could it be...?!</i>

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.410
D-Did they give up?

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.410
It's coming!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:22.410
What?!

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.290
Something really powerful is coming!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.210
I can feel its evil energy!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.590
Grampa, what's wrong?!

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:36.220
I-I know this intense energy!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:39.890
It appears my fears were correct.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:58.910
Your magic circle was quite an annoyance.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:02.080
So you're really back, Dark Lord!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:02.870
Dark Lord?!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.200
D-Dark Lord?!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.080
Hadlar!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.590
THE RESURRECTED DARK LORD
HADLAR

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.550
PUFF
FIRE DRAGON TRANSFORMATION SPELL

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.560
KASWOOSH
VORTEX-TYPE SPELL

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.850
The Dark Lord Hadlar?!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.530
There's no mistaking it.
It's the Dark Lord!

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:41.740
And that face and body...
He looks younger than I remember!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.910
He's overflowing with vitality!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.800
It's been a while, Avan, the Hero.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:58.840
Hero?!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.260
Master is the Hero?!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:06.430
Long ago, you thwarted
all of my ambitions,

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.600
and even took my life!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:14.400
<i>I will never forget
that pain and humiliation!</i>

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:20.820
You've already taken
hundreds of human lives!

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:27.450
Compared to a Darkling like me,
humans are nothing more than chattel!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:32.370
My life is worth more than thousands,
if not hundreds of millions of them!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.210
You're still the same.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:40.550
No. You're even more
disgusting than before.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.300
And I've grown tired of your Hero antics.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:44.970
That's right! Avan, the Hero!

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.720
The name of the legendary Hero

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:52.020
who fought and defeated the Dark Lord,
and brought peace to the world

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:53.730
was Avan!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.650
Is it true, Master?!

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.280
That was a long time ago.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.820
Now stay back!

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.950
No! I'll fight with you!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.620
You idiot! Come on!
You too, gramps!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.710
What are you doing, Popp?!
I have to fight, too!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:20.840
You moron!
We'll only get in the way!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:30.020
I can't believe Master
was the Hero who killed the Dark Lord!

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:33.600
I chose the wrong person to learn under!

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:36.310
So those are your students.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:44.070
I hear you're going about as a Hero tutor
training warriors of justice.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.530
I didn't expect that you'd return, though.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:52.830
How futile.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.290
Boom!

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:07.220
I'm glad that you came here yourself.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:11.060
I can defeat you here
and clear the darkness clouding the world!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.680
What rubbish!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.520
Sizzle!

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:26.320
Yes!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.560
What farce is this, Avan?!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.100
It didn't work?!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:00.980
Heat and explosion-type spells
are my forte!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.320
Did you think you could defeat me
with an ember like that?!

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.240
Watch!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:12.830
This is a true Sizzle!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.660
Sizzle!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:18.920
Wave Slash!

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:26.670
Master!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.350
What power...

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:37.980
You're even stronger
than when we last fought.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:39.730
How?!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:45.610
You want to know?
You'll regret hearing the answer.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:49.860
I see you still believe
that I'm the Dark Lord.

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.620
What do you mean?!

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:57.370
I was resurrected through the power
of a mighty ruler!

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.500
He gave me
a more powerful body than before!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:03.540
What?!

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.880
There's someone stronger
than the Dark Lord?!

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.550
Who is it?!

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.510
Vearn, the Dark King.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:15.890
The Dark King...

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.350
Vearn?!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.520
<i>That's right!
It was Vearn, the Dark King!</i>

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:27.570
<i>A mighty god of the Underworld
who resurrected me after my defeat to you!</i>

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.070
A god of the Underworld?!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:35.120
I had to sleep for over a decade
to replenish the power I lost,

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.750
but after my return,
I swore loyalty to Lord Vearn,

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:44.170
and was granted rule over his entire
Dark Army as his right hand man!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.920
I am now supreme commander
over Lord Vearn's armies!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:50.170
I am Hadlar, the Dark Commander!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.930
Unbelievable!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.680
There's someone stronger than him?!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:58.270
It's over! This world is over!

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:04.020
Vearn, the Dark King is my master
and an omnipotent Dark God!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:09.400
His armies are far greater than
mine ever were!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:14.910
No matter what you do,
you humans have no hope!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.160
What...

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.830
Avan, do you remember
our battle 15 years ago?

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:28.170
I offer you the same choice
I did back then.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:34.510
Join me! Do so and I shall grant you
half of the world!

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.180
Well?

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:43.270
Now that you sense your defeat,
perhaps you'll be more reasonable.

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:45.440
I refuse!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:52.820
Still the same answer.
You still can't see my mercy.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:55.700
You don't know what mercy is!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:01.040
Even if I agree,
you'd eventually take my life.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.670
Don't be so sure.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.960
Besides, I doubt you have the authority
to offer half of the world.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.470
Now that you're just
a servant of your Dark King.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.760
W-What?! A servant?!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.680
You dare call me
a servant of the Dark King?!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.850
I see I've struck a nerve.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.520
Silence!

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:36.030
So much for sparing you!
Your students can watch you turn to ash!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:39.620
That's the strongest
explosion-type spell there is! Kaboom!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:40.910
Master, look out!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:49.500
That stance!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.430
Eat this!

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:57.590
Kaboom!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.050
Avan Strash!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:10.940
Master!

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:23.410
A draw?!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:33.840
Ah, the attack that took my life,
Avan Strash.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.920
It cuts deep.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:36.670
However!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:51.020
It appears it lacks the edge
over my resurrected power!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.570
Master!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.660
Idiot! What are you doing?!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.870
I'm gonna fight!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:10.790
Don't be stupid! How can we
fight someone even Master can't beat?!

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:16.340
Master used Puff in our training!
He barely has any Magic Power left!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:18.840
That's right!

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:24.560
I've heard Puff takes three or four times
the Magic Power of a normal spell!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:25.640
Master...

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:27.060
Hey!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.140
You've grown weak, Avan.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:38.110
No. I suppose this is
the limit of a human's power.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.700
Let me ease your suffering.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:45.370
Stop!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:50.910
Do you want to die that much,
student of Avan?!

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.090
Dai...

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:12.650
Dai!

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.360
Darn... it...

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.120
You mean nothing to me.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.950
If you want to live, get out of my sight.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.920
Th-Thank you.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.790
Excuse us!

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:44.470
What?!

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.390
Blood?! Impossible!

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:51.980
That little brat's blade
drew blood from me?!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.480
Stop, boy.

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:00.690
Y-Yes sir?

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.490
I've changed my mind.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:16.630
I suppose no student of Avan
can be left alive after all.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.050
I'll slaughter you all!

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.260
Popp! Dai!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.800
Sizzle!

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:59.210
Master!

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:25.990
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.160 --> 00:22:36.210
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:08.200
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.030
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:19.330
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:36.600
<i>The resurrected Hadlar's power
was overwhelming.</i>

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:41.730
<i>Even Avan, who had once defeated him,
is forced into a corner.</i>

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:49.070
<i>When Avan shows his willingness to die
to protect Dai and for peace,</i>

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.410
<i>once again Dai's power awakens!</i>

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:56.410
<i>Next time on</i>
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:58.330
<i>"The Insignia of Avan"</i>

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.290
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
